# Pin line endings so file hashes are the same on every platform.
#
# crypto-manifest.json records the SHA-256 of each source file. Without this,
# git's autocrlf converts LF to CRLF on a Windows checkout, and a user who
# clones this repo and hashes a file gets a different digest from the one we
# published — making the manifest look wrong when nothing has changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
